{
  "name": "dsh-grant-cn",
  "version": "0.1.2",
  "description": "中文基金申请书检查（DeepSeek Harness）：19 项起步清单（项目名称/摘要/科学问题属性 A-D/立项依据/目标/内容/方案/技术路线/创新/可行性/基础/条件/团队/预算/预算说明/伦理/数据共享/限项/参考文献），预算算术与结构校验（设备费/业务费/劳务费/间接费用，合计一致性），申请材料包扫描（申请书/预算表/伦理/承诺书/简历/附件），输出 JSON/Markdown 与 REP 证据。关键词清单，不是评审结论。",
  "author": "PerryLink contributors",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/PerryLink/dsh-grant-cn.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/PerryLink/dsh-grant-cn#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/PerryLink/dsh-grant-cn/issues"
  },
  "private": false,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "src",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "README.md",
    "README-zh.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "SECURITY.md",
    "THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md"
  ],
  "sideEffects": false,
  "dsh": {
    "manifestVersion": 1,
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "research",
    "grant",
    "nsfc",
    "基金",
    "预算",
    "checklist"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.9.0",
    "dsh": ">=0.2.1-0 <0.3.0 || >=0.2.2-0 <0.3.0"
  },
  "packageManager": "pnpm@12.16.1",
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.5-alpha.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": ">=0.2.1-0 <0.3.0 || >=0.2.2-0 <0.3.0",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.5-alpha.1",
    "@perrylink/dsh-research-core": "^0.1.0"
  },
  "dependencies": {},
  "devDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.1.0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "0.2.2-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "~3.19.0",
    "@perrylink/dsh-research-core": "file:../dsh-research-core",
    "@types/node": "^22.20.5",
    "typescript": "^5.9.0",
    "vitest": "^3.2.0"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "clean": "node -e \"require('node:fs').rmSync('lib',{recursive:true,force:true})\"",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit && tsc -p tsconfig.test.json",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "test:watch": "vitest",
    "verify:package": "node scripts/verify-package.mjs"
  },
  "license": "Apache-2.0"
}
